},{"n":"Yaoyao","r":[0.0815,0.5563,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.1231,0.5563,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Sangonomiya Kokomi","r":[0.1648,0.5563,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.2065,0.5563,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Yaoyao","r":[0.0815,0.6133,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.1231,0.6133,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kuki Shinobu","r":[0.1648,0.6133,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.2065,0.6133,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Yaoyao","r":[0.0815,0.6644,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.1648,0.6644,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kuki Shinobu","r":[0.2065,0.6644,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/yaoyao/261111-225430/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Favonius Lance","text":"CRIT hits generate team particles. Build CRIT Rate; passive procs on-field."},{"name":"Dialogues of the Desert Sages","text":"HP and Energy from healing. Event weapon; passive needs healing."},{"name":"Moonpiercer","text":"Reaction leaf buffs ally ATK. Best for ATK-scaling teammates."},{"name":"Kitain Cross Spear","text":"EM and Skill-based Energy refund. Especially useful for Nilou Bloom."},{"name":"Black Tassel","text":"Huge HP% for stronger healing."},{"name":"Rightful Reward","text":"HP% and Energy after healing. Passive needs Yaoyao to receive healing."},{"name":"Skyward Spine","text":"ER stat; limited passive value."},{"name":"Dragon's Bane","text":"High EM for Bloom ownership. Use only if Yaoyao triggers Bloom."}],"a":[{"names":["Deepwood Memories"],"text":"Shreds enemy Dendro RES by 30%.","stats":"ER/HP% · HP% · Heal"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Skill hits grant party ATK buffs.","stats":"HP% · HP% · Heal"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"On-field reaction grants team EM.","stats":"ER/HP% · HP% · Heal"}],"t":[{"name":"Keqing Garden","members":["Yaoyao","Keqing","Fischl","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Yaoyao sustains Quicken and heals. Fischl adds Aggravate damage while Kazuha shreds Electro RES and buffs Keqing.","roles":["Healer / Dendro Enabler","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Blooming Oasis","members":["Yaoyao","Nilou","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nahida"],"text":"Nilou enables Bountiful Cores; Nahida supplies Dendro and Kokomi drives Bloom. Yaoyao adds healing against self-damage.","roles":["Dendro Healer","Bloom Enabler","Hydro Driver","Dendro Support"]},{"name":"Seedling Hyperbloom","members":["Yaoyao","Xingqiu","Kuki Shinobu","Nahida"],"text":"Xingqiu makes cores with Nahida; full-EM Kuki triggers Hyperbloom. Yaoyao adds Dendro and emergency healing.","roles":["Dendro Healer","Hydro Sub DPS","Hyperbloom Trigger","Dendro Support"]},{"name":"Budget Bloom Squad","members":["Yaoyao","Traveler (Dendro)","Xingqiu","Kuki Shinobu"],"text":"Traveler maintains Dendro with Yaoyao; Xingqiu creates cores and full-EM Kuki triggers Hyperbloom. Accessible core team.","roles":["Dendro Healer","Dendro Support","Hydro Sub DPS","Hyperbloom Trigger"]}],"v":"Nilou Bloom Healer: Prioritize HP and enough ER for frequent Burst. Keep Yaoyao on-field during Burst to heal the team.\nBloom Ownership: Build EM if Yaoyao personally triggers many Blooms; core damage depends on the trigger, not the healer.\nFavonius Battery: Build CRIT Rate to proc Favonius on-field; Skill healing covers most rotations without Burst.\nInstructor Buff: Trigger a Dendro reaction on-field before swapping to grant party EM; 4-star stats reduce healing.\nTenacity Buffer: Use with ATK-scaling carries when another teammate holds Deepwood Memories.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Healer / Support"],"about":"Yaoyao heals and applies Dendro with Yuegui for Quicken, Bloom and Hyperbloom teams. Her Skill heals off-field, while her Burst heals the party but requires field time. Build HP and enough Energy Recharge for your Burst needs.","pros":["Reliable off-field healing","Dendro application","Flexible reaction teams","Useful at C0"],"cons":["Burst takes field time","Low personal damage","Solo Dendro can need help","ER rises with frequent Burst"],"weapons":["Favonius Lance","Dialogues of the Desert Sages","Moonpiercer","Kitain Cross Spear","Black Tassel","Rightful Reward","Skyward Spine","Dragon's Bane"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["HP% / Energy Recharge","HP%","Healing Bonus / HP%"],"stats":["HP: 30k - 40k","ER: 100% - 150%","Burst ER: 190%+","Fav CR: 40%+"],"vars":[{"title":"Nilou Bloom Burst Healer","role":"Healer","weapons":["Dialogues of the Desert Sages","Kitain Cross Spear","Favonius Lance"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER/HP% sands, HP% goblet, Healing Bonus circlet; aim to Burst each rotation when necessary.","teams":"Nilou plus Hydro and Dendro only; enough teammates to create Bountiful Cores.","when":"Use for heavy Bountiful Core self-damage. Burst heals the party rapidly but Yaoyao must remain on-field.","cond":"High ER required; C2 helps greatly.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Bloom Trigger EM","role":"On-field Reaction Driver","weapons":["Kitain Cross Spear","Dragon's Bane","Moonpiercer"],"arts":[{"sets":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build enough ER first, then EM/EM/EM when Yaoyao owns substantial Bloom damage.","teams":"Consistent Hydro application; ideally Nilou Bloom, with safe healing.","when":"Use only if Yaoyao triggers a meaningful share of Bloom reactions. More EM does not improve cores created by other characters.","cond":"Reaction ownership determines damage.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Favonius Team Battery","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Dialogues of the Desert Sages"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use CRIT Rate circlet if needed to trigger Favonius; HP% and ER afterward.","teams":"Teams needing extra particles; Yaoyao must hit on-field for Favonius.","when":"Swap in for Skill and land a CRIT hit to generate particles, then return to your carry. Burst for emergency healing.","cond":"Needs enough CRIT Rate.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Instructor Reaction Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Moonpiercer"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP%/ER healer stats; some CRIT Rate for Favonius if equipped.","teams":"Reaction-based teammates; another unit should hold Deepwood when using Instructor.","when":"Trigger a reaction while Yaoyao is on-field, then swap to grant team Elemental Mastery.","cond":"4-star artifacts have lower main stats.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Tenacity ATK Buffer","role":"Healer / Buffer","weapons":["Black Tassel","Favonius Lance"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Focus HP% and Healing Bonus; ER as needed.","teams":"ATK-scaling damage dealers; another unit holds Deepwood Memories.","when":"Yuegui Skill hits refresh Tenacity ATK buffs while Yaoyao heals from off-field.","cond":"Not ideal when Dendro RES shred is missing.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Nagadus Emerald Sliver","Nagadus Emerald Fragment","Nagadus Emerald Chunk","Nagadus Emerald Gemstone","Quelled Creeper","Teachings of Diligence","Guide to Diligence","Philosophies of Diligence","Slime Condensate","Slime Secretions","Slime Concentrate","Jueyun Chili","Daka's Bell","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Not Priority"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Lvl 8 - 10"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Lvl 6 - 9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Keqing Garden","members":["Yaoyao","Keqing","Fischl","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Blooming Oasis","members":["Yaoyao","Nilou","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nahida"]},{"name":"Seedling Hyperbloom","members":["Yaoyao","Xingqiu","Kuki Shinobu","Nahida"]},{"name":"Budget Bloom Squad","members":["Yaoyao","Traveler (Dendro)","Xingqiu","Kuki Shinobu"]}]}}],"title":"Yaoyao","el":"Dendro"}